Z||000000||HugGRRRFiero||08-29-2000||11:27 AM||||I'm pretty new to the forum and have seen other guys post pictures of their cars.  I don't feel like starting an "ATTN: ORANGE FIERO OWNERS ONLY!!!" thread   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   so here are some before and after pictures of mine.  If you own an orange Fiero, you can post a picture of it here anyway.<P>Feel free to post any comments or suggestions...<P><A HREF="http://members.fortunecity.com/bbjproducts/gallery/brentscar/brentscar.html" TARGET=_blank>Current Pictures</A><BR><A HREF="http://members.fortunecity.com/bbjproducts/gallery/brentscar/before.html" TARGET=_blank>Before Pictures (Can't believe that's the same car!)</A><BR><A HREF="http://members.fortunecity.com/bbjproducts/gallery/brentscar/stage1.html" TARGET=_blank>First Stage (Sand/Replace/Prep)</A><BR><A HREF="http://members.fortunecity.com/bbjproducts/gallery/brentscar/stage2.html" TARGET=_blank>Second Stage (Primer)</A><BR><A HREF="http://members.fortunecity.com/bbjproducts/gallery/brentscar/stage3.html" TARGET=_blank>Third Stage (Paint)</A><BR><A HREF="http://members.fortunecity.com/bbjproducts/gallery/brentscar/show.html" TARGET=_blank>Show pictures!</A><P>I've been working on the Fiero for the last year, drive it daily, and I still have a long way to go.  I did all of the sanding, replacing, interior swap, and prep work.  I give credit to John Owen, my Uncle, for the excellent finish, he did an GRRReat job spraying the paint!<P>Thanks,<P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">        <BR>        <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> <p>[This message has been edited by HugGRRRFiero (edited 08-29-2000).]||||reg||14
