Z||000006||HugGRRRFiero||08-29-2000||04:41 PM||||Carrolles:<BR>Yes, it's base/clear PPG paint.<P>1FST2M6:<BR>Can't wait to see your's finished!  Have you had it painted yet?<P>Shaft:<BR>I know, I drive as careful as I can, and I've already blown out a lower control arm bushing.  The guy who replaced it before bunged it up pretty good and he wound up welding it in and the welds broke.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  I'm still debating how low to go, probably just lower it an inch, nothing too drastic.<p>[This message has been edited by HugGRRRFiero (edited 08-29-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||DXR_DAD||08-29-2000||08:34 PM||||That is NICE!!!!!!!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Man that is a pro job you did on it!! I don't know very many shops that do that good but it feels better to say "I did it myself" so I'm sure you will be having some people calling you for your services. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>DXR_DAD||||reg||14
